5. P1 — BUILD THE PIR REGISTER
Goal

Create a short, prioritized list of intelligence questions that support real decisions and actions.
PIR Rule

A PIR is not just a topic.

Bad:
text

Ransomware
Phishing
APT groups
Vulnerabilities

Good:
text

Which actively exploited vulnerabilities affect our internet-facing,
identity, email, remote-access, cloud, or critical technologies,
and what action should the responsible owner take?

PIR Formula
text

Decision / action needed
    → Intelligence question
    → Required EEIs
    → Collection source
    → Delivery method
    → Action owner
    → Measure of success

