When to Add a Named Actor

Only add a named actor if at least one is true:

    The actor appeared in a prior internal incident.
    The actor targets similar organizations or close peers.
    The actor targets our mission, geography, industry, partners, or data.
    The actor exploits technology we actually use.
    The actor’s behaviors require specific hunts, detections, or mitigations.

Definition of Done

    Five or fewer scenarios are prioritized.
    Each scenario maps to critical assets or functions.
    Each scenario has likely entry points and defensive actions.
    Named actors are included only when they change a decision or action.

